tyle="margin: 16px 0px;"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px"><span style="margin: 0px"><font color="#000000"><iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/8BjbwpK6_1o?si=0MXzwk6uQBSD0ifk" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen=""></iframe></font></span></span></span></p><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px;"><span style="margin: 0px">This module is part of Utrecht University’s broader efforts in </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">transdisciplinary education</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px;"><span style="margin: 0px">, which brings together students, academic actors (researchers and teachers), and extra-academic actors (from public and private sectors) to c</span><span style="margin: 0px">o</span><span style="margin: 0px">llaboratively address societal challenges.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px;">&nbsp;</span></font></span></p></div></body>
